BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Life With Full Attention
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T214500
UID:4be8410e855e4b691be37b9e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Buddhism’s vision of infinite consciousness\, exemplified by
  the Buddha\, is a vision of our human potential. We’re like an acorn th
 at doesn’t realise its potential is to be an oak tree. But we’re almos
 t perpetually distracted – planning\, worrying and fantasizing.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/life-with-full-attention
 -feb-2026
END:VEVENT
